// test-adr: 051
// test-error
// #1268 review: a divisor cast to a type nothing declares is the undefined
// type's error (E0426): the analysis cannot say it is a number, so it is not
// E0800's to judge. Main reported E0426; the stage order this PR set reported
// E0800 until the divisor rule required a known type for every operand.
// typed-cast-divisor.test.cnx holds the casts to a known type, which E0800
// rejects.

u32 f(u32 n) {
    return n / (Nope)0;
}

void main() {}
